content.text:
I now have enough evidence to issue the Round 9 verdict. The key finding: DocCogito's paper (a cited key reference) explicitly reports **Qwen3-VL-8B-Instruct zero-shot InfoVQA = 75.7%**, and DocCogito-8B achieves 78.6% — a **+2.9 improvement over zero-shot**, not below it as the proposal repeatedly claims.

