    "novelty": {
      "score": 4,
      "rationale": "Explicit typed spatial graph (Caption-of/Adjacent/directional) + generative VLM traversal chain training is genuinely differentiated from DocCogito (implicit layout tokens), MGA-VQA (untyped OCR boxes), PDF-VQA (extractive GCN). The four-axis differentiation from DocCogito is architecturally clear. However the empirical advantage remains unproven."
