      "score": 3,
      "rationale": "Highly detailed in structure, but contains a repeated factual error about the Qwen3-VL-8B-Instruct InfoVQA zero-shot baseline (claimed 80-84%, actual 75.7% per DocCogito's own table) that undermines the DocCogito motivation narrative throughout the proposal."
