      "rationale": "InfographicVQA hard multi-hop subset is a real target. A single trained open-source 8B model with explicit layout reasoning is practically useful. But the WikiMixQA contribution is already framed as expected negative, and the overall InfoVQA gain above DocCogito's 78.6% (itself only +2.9 over zero-shot) is unproven."
